    <!-- How to play -->
    <string name="rules_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="rules_1">Each player secretly picks a number of 3–6 different digits. 0 may be the first digit.</string>
    <string name="rules_2">Every round both players guess the other\'s number at the same time and get a hint.</string>
    <string name="rules_3">Strike (S): right digit, right place. Ball (B): right digit, wrong place. OUT: no digit matches.</string>
    <string name="rules_4">Example: secret 0 4 7, guess 0 7 5 → 1S 1B (0 is a strike, 7 is a ball).</string>
    <string name="rules_5">Get all strikes first to win. If both solve it in the same round, it is a draw.</string>
    <string name="rules_6">Team play: teammates are paired 1 vs 1 with the other team, and the team with more duel wins takes the match. Ties are possible.</string>

